{"words": [{"text": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ", "translation": "But they denied him"}, {"text": "فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ", "translation": "so We saved him"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "مَعَهُۥ", "translation": "(were) with him"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْفُلْكِ", "translation": "the ship"}, {"text": "وَأَغْرَقْنَا", "translation": "And We drowned"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "translation": "denied"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ ۚ", "translation": "Our Verses"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translation": "Indeed, they"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "were"}, {"text": "قَوْمًا", "translation": "a people"}, {"text": "عَمِينَ", "translation": "blind"}], "sahih": "But they denied him, so We saved him and those who were with him in the ship. And We drowned those who denied Our signs. Indeed, they were a blind people.1"}